WEBVTT

00:09:57.037 --> 00:10:00.080
because they have authority over us,

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.940
but we would not follow them.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:03.974
And I know many people

00:10:03.974 --> 00:10:05.336
who are at the bottoms of organizations

00:10:05.336 --> 00:10:06.599
who have no authority

00:10:06.599 --> 00:10:08.662
and they are absolutely leaders,

00:10:08.662 --> 00:10:10.447
and this is because they have chosen to look after

00:10:10.447 --> 00:10:11.965
the person to the left of them,

00:10:11.965 --> 00:10:13.243
and they have chosen to look after

00:10:13.243 --> 00:10:15.037
the person to the right of them.

00:10:15.037 --> 00:10:19.770
This is what a leader is.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:22.800
I heard a story

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.390
of some Marines

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:27.711
who were out in theater,

00:10:27.711 --> 00:10:29.757
and as is the Marine custom,

00:10:29.757 --> 00:10:32.082
the officer ate last,